{
  "about": "Every API route, request field and query parameter the website uses. tests/api-contract.test.mjs fails when the site calls a route not listed here; clip-api/tests/test_web_contract.py fails when a listed route or field is missing from the API's /openapi.json. `optional`: the site looks the route up in /openapi.json (lib/routes.ts) and works without it. `response`: top-level fields the site reads from that GET, checked by calling it as a fresh account. `optional_body`: fields of a newer API version (link ranges): skipped while no route takes them, required on every listed route once one does. `clip_fields`: fields of a clip object the site reads (judge v2 adds `scores`, `scoring_version`). `edit_options`: the option names an edit may carry (`edit_options_optional`: names a newer API adds, such as caption_look; the site sends them only when /openapi.json describes them) (lib/edit.ts forApi); the backend test checks them against the edit's own option model.",
